DisplaySet,#ChargeOversizeinsert=Yes, ------------------- Do you upcharge for oversize custom insert sizes[Yes;No]
Do,(#ChargeOversizeinsert="Yes")|(#DisplayEdit):1
{
   DisplaySet,#ChargeOversizeinsertupsizew=36, ---------------------- Max width for no-upcharge (wider will be charged)?
   DisplaySet,#ChargeOversizeinsertpercentw=.25, ---------------------- Percent to upcharge for oversize custom insert.
   DisplaySet,#ChargeOversizeinsertupsized=24, ---------------------- Max depth for no-upcharge (deeper will be charged)?
   DisplaySet,#ChargeOversizeinsertpercentd=.25, ---------------------- Percent to upcharge for oversize custom insert.
}
 
